# NPM Improved
#
# The management UI no longer runs inside Nginx. Port NPM_ADMIN_PORT (81 by
# default) is owned by the standalone npm-improved-control-plane binary.
#
# This file intentionally contains no server block. Keeping the management
# listener outside the Nginx data plane means a failed proxy configuration,
# failed Nginx reload, or stopped Nginx process cannot make the recovery UI
# unavailable.
